description	"The Jedi Sage

This jedi forgoes the use of a lightsaber to become the ultimate in force abilities. They posess an immense force pool but only a normal regeneration rate, so they must manage their powers judiciously. 

^2Weaponry:
- Melee

^5Force Powers:
- Jump  (3)
- Push  (3)
- Pull  (3)
- Sense (3)
- Mind Trick (1)
- Speed (1)
- Protect (3)
- Absorb (3)
- Drain (3)
- Lightning (3)
- Grip (3)
- Repulse ^5[CS1 Melee]

^8Attributes:
- Force Block (1)
- Force Focus (3)
- CTF: 35s Respawn

^2Strengths^7: Unrivaled mastery of the force.
^1Weaknesses^7: No lightsaber defenses what-so-ever."